'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.c2t/comments/comments.ti :: ''   passes        : x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\n''   options       : (none)\n''\n'' Generated from C. Search for C2T-TODO and translate those parts by hand.\n''\n'' 2 items need manual translation:\n''   line 27  comments.h:14  C2T-TODO(not-yet)  after_comment\n''   line 31  comments.h:17  C2T-TODO(not-yet)  trailing\n'' =============================================================================\n\n/' comments.h -- every comment shape c2t converts. '/\n#pragma once\n\n'' a line comment\n''' a doc line comment\n/' a block '/   /' and a second on the same line '/\n\n/'*\n * A multi-line doc block. It quotes tiko's own delimiters, ' / and / ',\n * which must not open or close a tiko comment.\n '/\n\n'' C2T-TODO(not-yet) comments.h:14 -- declaration -- c2t P1 translates no declarations yet\n'' /* a block comment that starts here\n''    and ends on the declaration's line */ int after_comment;\n\n'' C2T-TODO(not-yet) comments.h:17 -- declaration -- c2t P1 translates no declarations yet\n'' int trailing; // a trailing comment goes into the quote\n'' a line comment spliced\n''    onto the next line\n\n
